<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108762" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπ-ομβρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mixed with rain,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέρος ὕ.</span> a <i>rainy</i> summer,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				3
			</span></i> (as v. l. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπομβρον</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; ἔαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					1.12.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					450.49
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				82.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				97.27
			</span></i>; <i>impregnated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσφάλτῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπομβρον ὀστέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>, who explains it as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόνομον καὶ
				κάθυγρον γεγονός,</span> and ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.149
			</span></i>, who says <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕφυγρον,
			ὑπόπυον,</span> where the reference is to <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόλις ὕπομβρον γενόμενον καὶ
				κατακλυσθὲν τὸ ἱερεῖον</span> apparently
			<i>drenched,</i> as t.t. in divination, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.438a
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
